?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=a433898987a9a05d65725e7482da722e", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/145f4652/uploads/origins/46f4b221-7c22-48e3-9e8b-3e06a8c24717?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=a433898987a9a05d65725e7482da722e, https://si.imgix.net/145f4652/uploads/origins/46f4b221-7c22-48e3-9e8b-3e06a8c24717?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=71e69e051a854fca2408b2b4375e0b3a 2x, https://si.imgix.net/145f4652/uploads/origins/46f4b221-7c22-48e3-9e8b-3e06a8c24717?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=e456aa53987fd41133b09136af346479 3x"}, "body": "Hello, it's me again!\n\nOnce again, it's about characters I play in a tabletop RPG with my friends.\nThis time it's about two characters who are out (as a couple 👀) on the beach.\n\nI'd like an image of them both on this outing. They are sitting on a rock in the water, with the setting sun behind them. The details of the characters' clothing and positions are shown in the images.\n\nIf possible, please provide me with a PSD file, as I did previously!\n\nThank you very much, and have a nice day! 💖\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1PjrUDk_ol-sydekrT_i9MVlgQ8AQb1aP?usp=sharing", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@midoriwataru/works/6", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2347395, "client_id": 2681390, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/2827d114/uploads/origins/ecaf7e98-1621-4237-a360-f9b9d2272161?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ba62988db20bc3b46c3273ab2550a12d", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/2827d114/uploads/origins/ecaf7e98-1621-4237-a360-f9b9d2272161?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ba62988db20bc3b46c3273ab2550a12d, https://si.imgix.net/2827d114/uploads/origins/ecaf7e98-1621-4237-a360-f9b9d2272161?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=417183451d22cbcf18c801371cd7b463 2x, https://si.imgix.net/2827d114/uploads/origins/ecaf7e98-1621-4237-a360-f9b9d2272161?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=cfa0e05ca4ea216de712318ac8e83e86 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/2827d114/uploads/origins/ecaf7e98-1621-4237-a360-f9b9d2272161?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=ef208f30e991cb54e0626522f4422226", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/2827d114/uploads/origins/ecaf7e98-1621-4237-a360-f9b9d2272161?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=ef208f30e991cb54e0626522f4422226, https://si.imgix.net/2827d114/uploads/origins/ecaf7e98-1621-4237-a360-f9b9d2272161?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=66ff71506f1df54c83cb823745826d95 2x, https://si.imgix.net/2827d114/uploads/origins/ecaf7e98-1621-4237-a360-f9b9d2272161?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=fa2f7bc418efc0b80f52e9c29e28ffad 3x"}, "body": "さくら色みたいな薄いピンク色の髪でロングヘアーで、むらさき色の瞳の、柔らかい雰囲気で少しふわふわしたかわいい系の女の子を描いてほしいです。服装はセーラー襟でフリルとリボンたっぷりのロリータっぽい感じか、チャイナ系ロリータか、和風ロリータっぽい感じの、どれかでお願いしたいです。\nスチームパンク的な要素もあればいいかもとか思います。女の子は幸せそうに微笑んでいてほしいです。そんな感じのを見たいです。以上です。", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@midoriwataru/works/5", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2347395, "client_id": 3426199, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/d552aa65/uploads/origins/c9b16f48-f4df-4a5c-9faf-b0339d7e804d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e06cd6f9aa7a1f9850ac1e848408b252", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/d552aa65/uploads/origins/c9b16f48-f4df-4a5c-9faf-b0339d7e804d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e06cd6f9aa7a1f9850ac1e848408b252, https://si.imgix.net/d552aa65/uploads/origins/c9b16f48-f4df-4a5c-9faf-b0339d7e804d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6f02c0788dde4b2178aaae201c59222b 2x, https://si.imgix.net/d552aa65/uploads/origins/c9b16f48-f4df-4a5c-9faf-b0339d7e804d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a51c912de904a3310af6591340e83302 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/d552aa65/uploads/origins/c9b16f48-f4df-4a5c-9faf-b0339d7e804d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=356adb6e71515702cbf6fa47e87f5633", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/d552aa65/uploads/origins/c9b16f48-f4df-4a5c-9faf-b0339d7e804d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=356adb6e71515702cbf6fa47e87f5633, https://si.imgix.net/d552aa65/uploads/origins/c9b16f48-f4df-4a5c-9faf-b0339d7e804d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=280c8f2e5657c659ed4cb674b05e8e13 2x, https://si.imgix.net/d552aa65/uploads/origins/c9b16f48-f4df-4a5c-9faf-b0339d7e804d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=59fdf918a73dd6fd9ea417751da25c1b 3x"}, "body": "Hello!\n\nI have a new request for you!\n\nOnce again, it's about a character I play in a tabletop RPG with my friends. His name is Mathis Ester, and he's also a vigilante operating in a universe similar to the manga Boku no Hero Academia (I guess I really enjoy playing this type of character).\n\nTo help you better understand the character, here’s a short description:\n\nMathis is a 21-year-old young man, always positive and smiling. He’s kind and brave, and has always looked up to his older brother Florian, whom he greatly admires.\nBy day, Mathis is an independent journalist who reports directly from the field, covering heroes and villains alike. He also summarizes the news on his YouTube channel.\nBy night, he’s a vigilante who helps people escape from villains whenever he crosses paths with them!\n\nMathis is rather slim but quite muscular, as he has practiced kendo since childhood, especially with his brother. He has black hair, always styled the same way, and blue eyes. He usually wears a white collared sweatshirt and navy or black pants. He really likes to dress “neatly but simply,” and he loves wearing white tops.\n\nMathis's power allows him to summon a creature named Corvy.\nCorvy has several forms depending on the energy it absorbs (it can absorb people's energy through touch). It starts off as a small metal crow, then evolves into a sort of small metallic dinosaur. It also practices a bird-dinosaur style martial art!\n\nI'd love to have an image representing Mathis and Corvy in a dynamic, battle-ready pose!\nMathis is wearing an outfit with elements described in an attached sheet along with reference images. He also carries a katana.\nIf possible, I’d like Mathis’s face to be clearly visible. I’ve included a reference pose, but if you have a better idea, feel free to go with it!\nAs for the art style, you already know how much I loved your illustrations of Atarashii Ashi from Kakenukero—I think that style would be perfect again!\n\nIf it’s possible to get the PSD file like last time, that would be perfect!\n\nThank you in advance, and I wish you a very good day!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1rItwH0hnyir3I_pBig5mDvHluPrxasxy?usp=sharing", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@midoriwataru/works/4", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/c22507e7/uploads/origins/91733f88-cff2-4d52-985a-7e570e72eca2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=3b5ff16238029260c772d37cc8400bae", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/c22507e7/uploads/origins/91733f88-cff2-4d52-985a-7e570e72eca2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=3b5ff16238029260c772d37cc8400bae, https://si.imgix.net/c22507e7/uploads/origins/91733f88-cff2-4d52-985a-7e570e72eca2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=77afa0bedf04aefdae19187dfcf8d527 2x, https://si.imgix.net/c22507e7/uploads/origins/91733f88-cff2-4d52-985a-7e570e72eca2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=5ac91fdf39dc8f6e37b60e58a7d07cd9 3x"}, "private": true, "genre": "comic", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2347395, "nc": 16}, {"path": "/@midoriwataru/works/3", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2347395, "client_id": 3426199, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/b3e2f906/uploads/origins/7f09412f-27ec-4b44-badf-15aec88294f8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=dc24415b536fbc9543463630ea3dfe0b", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/b3e2f906/uploads/origins/7f09412f-27ec-4b44-badf-15aec88294f8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=dc24415b536fbc9543463630ea3dfe0b, https://si.imgix.net/b3e2f906/uploads/origins/7f09412f-27ec-4b44-badf-15aec88294f8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1e878223d3df4bcc4327c640a0e4acce 2x, https://si.imgix.net/b3e2f906/uploads/origins/7f09412f-27ec-4b44-badf-15aec88294f8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=15137c4285df09e9e66b45560938338b 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/b3e2f906/uploads/origins/7f09412f-27ec-4b44-badf-15aec88294f8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=869a5ee39efbbcefaf02c139abbb9ea7", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/b3e2f906/uploads/origins/7f09412f-27ec-4b44-badf-15aec88294f8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=869a5ee39efbbcefaf02c139abbb9ea7, https://si.imgix.net/b3e2f906/uploads/origins/7f09412f-27ec-4b44-badf-15aec88294f8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=7114339e5b69a22254168ecdb58ee0f0 2x, https://si.imgix.net/b3e2f906/uploads/origins/7f09412f-27ec-4b44-badf-15aec88294f8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=dd40ddd535d52d6108046c9596fd1f5f 3x"}, "body": "Hi ! \nAs promised, here is my request!\n\nI would like you to draw the character I play in a role-playing game with my friends. His name is \"Hunter Garcia\", you have all the details in the document below.\n\nLet me introduce you to Hunter Garcia, a vigilante in a universe similar to Boku no Hero Academia.\nHe has a dual power that allows him to manipulate purple lightning and purple flames (if you want to make him use his powers on the drawing!).\n\nHere is a brief description of the character to help you understand him better:\n\nHunter is a 20-year-old character who is confident, sociable, intelligent, quite talkative, honest, and altruistic. He is studying to create equipment for heroes at the best university in the United States. He is passionate about computers, technology, and DIY projects.\n\nAlongside his studies, he has many personal projects, notably improving his prosthetic arm, which has built-in phone functionalities. He also enjoys making small gadgets of all kinds. Hunter engages in a lot of sports, particularly self-defense, to avoid getting beaten up when acting as a vigilante.\n\nHunter is relatively slim but muscular. He has medium-length white/gray hair, red eyes, and slightly pointed ears. He has a scar over his left eye (shaped like a lightning bolt) and wears a mechanical prosthetic arm and a mechanical eye (the black eye), as he lost his arm and eye in a fire when he was a child.\n\nHis left arm is a true multi-purpose tool, equipped with over 30 tools, including a screwdriver, small electric saw, knife, pliers, etc., all integrated through an ingenious rolling system that allows interchangeable parts from within. It does not have batteries and is powered entirely by the heat continuously generated by Hunter’s body. Hunter cannot easily remove his arm (as it could damage the neurotransmitters), so he keeps it on most of the time, only taking it off when he needs to repair or upgrade it.\n\nBelow, I have the first image of the character (version 0) as well as the redesigns I commissioned from an artist on Twitter named Nandry.\n\nYou are free to pose the character however you like (preferably showing his whole body), create it in your own style (you know how much I loved your drawings of Atarashii Ashi from Kakenukero), and make any design improvements to enhance the character further. I trust your judgment on this!\n\nIf it is possible to have two versions (one with her \"vigilante\" clothes, and one with her civilian clothes), that would be very nice and perfect, but I think it might be a little too much for a single order, so if it's too much, let me know, and you can only make the civilian version.\n\nIf possible, having a version with and without background (and the source PSD file so I can export it without the background and the quality I want myself) would be great!\n\nFor reference, you will find several images in the document, version 0 aligns the most with my vision of the character’s colors and haircut, but version 1 shows him in full body and with his prosthetic arm. The shirtless version also shows the connection with his prosthetic.\n\nYou will also find in the folder the references that I gave to make version 1 and 2.\n\n\nDon't hesitate to ask me if there are any details needed!\n\nMany thanks in advance and I wish you a very good day!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1UBtrC_vhSDnTara5hY8xyNHNEgsV7lMp?usp=sharing", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@midoriwataru/works/2", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2347395, "client_id": 3090461, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/124804db/uploads/origins/6b079bd1-64be-46e5-b581-bc3cd688b2b1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c923325605f3726544ec1b9f86c9641c", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/124804db/uploads/origins/6b079bd1-64be-46e5-b581-bc3cd688b2b1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c923325605f3726544ec1b9f86c9641c, https://si.imgix.net/124804db/uploads/origins/6b079bd1-64be-46e5-b581-bc3cd688b2b1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b2c553ce28a7dca63666936b42abc99d 2x, https://si.imgix.net/124804db/uploads/origins/6b079bd1-64be-46e5-b581-bc3cd688b2b1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=194d4b4d6b0436a05e15fc92ab87b5ff 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/124804db/uploads/origins/6b079bd1-64be-46e5-b581-bc3cd688b2b1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=2f18831c044ad53961922ad9f4ab8084", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/124804db/uploads/origins/6b079bd1-64be-46e5-b581-bc3cd688b2b1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=2f18831c044ad53961922ad9f4ab8084, https://si.imgix.net/124804db/uploads/origins/6b079bd1-64be-46e5-b581-bc3cd688b2b1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=fb38cf90db5f1b6f5f832b9b4cc8c889 2x, https://si.imgix.net/124804db/uploads/origins/6b079bd1-64be-46e5-b581-bc3cd688b2b1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=1cdd52c2082baa75c9ebe75fb9c1fff4 3x"}, "body": "初めまして。\nxにてお試し期間のポストを拝見し、過去作品やpixiv等を見させていただきました。\nどのイラストもすっと情報が入ってくる上に、キャラクターの魅せ方がめっちゃ好きです。\nskebの絵も非常に素敵です。\n是非みどりわたる様のタッチで描かれるうちの子を見てみたいと思い、リクエストさせていただきました。\n\nキャラ設定等は下記資料URLに格納しております。\n分割された多層世界になぜか爆誕した怪異ちゃんです。\n\n〇構図\n納品はpsdを希望いたします。\n服装等は可変のキャラです。構図など、アレンジ含め自由にして頂いて構いません。\nちょっぴりダーク寄りなキャラですが、普段はその辺で普通に食事をしたりしています\n(日中は擬態しているため、資料の恰好は主に夜半)\nダーク寄りでも、日常寄りでも、お好きに表現していただけると嬉しいです。\nよろしくお願いいたします！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1Yg6yodbUR_MTDy9yCrWRaoBLyxQLBzo3?usp=sharing", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@midoriwataru/works/1", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2347395, "client_id": 57223, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/d8cb3546/uploads/origins/9ffb6df7-34b2-4840-9598-98a98e81ab90?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c7fe9c694c00cb11c45c9492e8cfe731", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/d8cb3546/uploads/origins/9ffb6df7-34b2-4840-9598-98a98e81ab90?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c7fe9c694c00cb11c45c9492e8cfe731, https://si.imgix.net/d8cb3546/uploads/origins/9ffb6df7-34b2-4840-9598-98a98e81ab90?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6b0c4154db5